    "notes": "All 69 full pairs read. Two single-status strings corrected and reread after native SocialPage inspection: farmer rows load Single_Female for either gender, so both Greek forms use gender-neutral χωρίς σχέση. Boyfriend/girlfriend branches describe the current player relationship. Hat Mouse deliberately retains broken speech, misspelling and πόκε nickname; source mail and phone dialogue inspected for future consistency. Merchant claims, weekly stock, tool turnaround, wallet items and proficiency terms preserved."
